      "versionNonce": 1982303146,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How the code really does it:\n\n\u2022 No repository layer - services\n  use CoreGridDbContext directly.\n\u2022 External services sit behind\n  interfaces: IIdentityDirectory,\n  IFileStorageService,\n  INotificationService.\n\u2022 Agents run in-process in the\n  Application layer; only the\n  model call leaves the API.\n\u2022 Every write is audited by\n  AuditSaveChangesInterceptor.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How the code really does it:\n\n\u2022 No repository layer - services\n  use CoreGridDbContext directly.\n\u2022 External services sit behind\n  interfaces: IIdentityDirectory,\n  IFileStorageService,\n  INotificationService.\n\u2022 Agents run in-process in the\n  Application layer; only the\n  model call leaves the API.\n\u2022 Every write is audited by\n  AuditSaveChangesInterceptor.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 13
    }
  ],
